{"title":"불사군신","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=bAb3ls/dJMcagmgGuO/rD7RmmKlLG4ayGQ4l3RgF1&filename=th3","synopsis":"이 작품은 腹黑的蚂蚁의 소설 不死战神(2015)을 한국어로 옮긴 것입니다.\n\n엽가의 둔재 엽진은 우연한 기회로 고대 토템을 손에 넣었는데.\n각 토템 하나하나를 활성화할 때마다, 하나의 신비한 능력이 열리고 한 권의 고대 무학을 익힐 수 있다.\n이후 엽진은 더 이상 무능한 외문 제자가 아닌, 단숨에 떠오르며 천하에 이름을 떨치는 괴물 같은 존재가 된다.\n고대 요수를 베고, 지존급 보물을 쟁취하며, 위험천만한 비경에 들어가 절세 강자들과 싸운다.\n눈을 뗄 수 없는 강자의 길, 그 모든 것이 담긴 이야기.","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-27","rank":247,"change":null},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":162,"change":{"type":"up","amount":85}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":215,"change":{"type":"down","amount":53}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":239,"change":{"type":"down","amount":24}},{"date":"2026-08-31","rank":199,"change":{"type":"up","amount":40}},{"date":"2026-09-01","rank":94,"change":{"type":"up","amount":105}},{"date":"2026-09-02","rank":171,"change":{"type":"down","amount":77}},{"date":"2026-09-03","rank":255,"change":{"type":"down","amount":84}},{"date":"2026-09-06","rank":212,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-07","rank":288,"change":{"type":"down","amount":76}},{"date":"2026-09-08","rank":235,"change":{"type":"up","amount":53}},{"date":"2026-09-10","rank":248,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-11","rank":235,"change":{"type":"up","amount":13}},{"date":"2026-09-12","rank":242,"change":{"type":"down","amount":7}}],"weekly":[{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":282,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":237,"change":{"type":"up","amount":45}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":208,"change":{"type":"up","amount":29}},{"date":"2026-08-31","rank":176,"change":{"type":"up","amount":32}},{"date":"2026-09-01","rank":128,"change":{"type":"up","amount":48}},{"date":"2026-09-02","rank":120,"change":{"type":"up","amount":8}},{"date":"2026-09-03","rank":122,"change":{"type":"down","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-09-04","rank":143,"change":{"type":"down","amoun